    <labels>
        <fullName>Core_MAG_Intro</fullName>
        <categories>Core_MAGQuestionnaireController</categories>
        <language>en_US</language>
        <protected>false</protected>
        <shortDescription>Core_MAG_Intro</shortDescription>
        <value>Please complete this form. You may enter partial information and select ‘save’ but it will be reviewed only when complete. Your opportunity may be subject to regulatory requirements. Compliance status does NOT imply or confer government authorization for any transaction.&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;b&gt;Intel users &lt;/b&gt;may find requirements for sales and related services &amp; support Intel conducts at &lt;a href=&quot;https://goto.intel.com/mindssalesguardrails&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;goto/mindssalesguardrails&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://goto.intel.com/mindsipsguardrails&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;goto/mindsipsguardrails&lt;/a&gt; . It is your responsibility to stop and contact GEC with any concerns about compliance.&lt;br/&gt;</value>
    </labels>
