        <shortDescription>Core_MAG_Q1</shortDescription>
        <value>1. What is the End Customer use of Intel items in this opportunity? Enter all that apply.
&lt;ol type = &quot;A&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Military, intelligence, or defense item or application&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nuclear/biochemical item or application&lt;/li&gt;
