        <shortDescription>Core_MAG_Q2</shortDescription>
        <value>2. Does this opportunity include ONLY Intel items with existing SKUs, have no separate BINs, and does not change/develop, modify, or enhance the original Intel item in any way? Enter Yes or No</value>
