        <shortDescription>Billboard/Transit POP Requirements Information</shortDescription>
        <value>1.Proof of Attribution (POA) – digital media file(s) meeting attribution requirements

2.Proof of Cost (POC) – itemized invoice issued by a media owner or marketing services agency

3.Proof of Execution (POE) – report issued by a third party showing:
a.One unmodified photo of an actual installation of each version of the ad creative photographed between the ad start and end dates (# of versions = # of installation photos)
b.Number of ads, ad sizes, and locations
c.Media placement cost per location including installation and removal costs</value>
