    <labels>
        <fullName>Core_MDF_Buyer_Bundle_Offer_POP_Req_Info</fullName>
        <categories>POP Requirements Information</categories>
        <language>en_US</language>
        <protected>false</protected>
        <shortDescription>Buyer - Bundle/Offer POP Requirements Information</shortDescription>
        <value>1.Proof of Attribution (POA) – digital media file(s) meeting attribution requirements
a.Promotion materials with program period, eligible Intel SKUs and items given away as bundle

2. Proof of Cost (POC) – itemized reports issued by the member or industry partner, showing:
a.Sales out report showing sales of eligible products and who, what, how many, when information
b.Itemized report issued by a member or third party showing quantity and cost of bundled items
c.If seeking reimbursement for non-award costs: itemized report issued by a member or third party

3. Proof of Execution (POE) – Same as POA and POC</value>
    </labels>
    <labels>
        <fullName>Core_MDF_Buyer_Reward_Frequency_POP_Req_Info</fullName>
        <categories>POP Requirements Information</categories>
        <language>en_US</language>
        <protected>false</protected>
        <shortDescription>Buyer - Reward/Frequency POP Requirements Information</shortDescription>
        <value>1.Proof of Attribution (POA) – digital media file(s) meeting attribution requirements
a.Copy of program announcement

2. Proof of Cost (POC) – itemized reports issued by the member or industry partner, showing:
a.Sales out report showing sales of eligible products and accrued reward points
b.If seeking reimbursement for non-award costs: itemized report issued by a member or third party

3. Proof of Execution (POE) – Same as POA and POC</value>
    </labels>
    <labels>
        <fullName>Core_MDF_Buyer_Sweepstakes_POP_Req_Info</fullName>
        <categories>POP Requirements Information</categories>
        <language>en_US</language>
        <protected>false</protected>
        <shortDescription>Buyer - Sweepstakes POP Requirements Information</shortDescription>
        <value>1.Proof of Attribution (POA) – digital media file(s) meeting attribution requirements
a.Copy of program announcement

2. Proof of Cost (POC) – itemized reports issued by the member or industry partner, showing:
a.Quantity and costs of prizes and giveaways
b.If seeking reimbursement for non-award costs: itemized report issued by a member or third party

3. Proof of Execution (POE) – Same as POA and POC</value>
    </labels>
