        <value>1.Proof of Attribution (POA) – digital media file(s) meeting attribution requirements
a.For giveaways: one photo per type of item showing Intel logo

2.Proof of Cost (POC) – itemized invoice or report issued by the member or a third party

3.Proof of Execution (POE) – report issued by the member or a third party
Report may include these types of details:
a. Number of pieces, media placement, delivery or postage unit cost and quantity
