    <labels>
        <fullName>Core_MDF_Magazine_Newspaper_POP_Req_Info</fullName>
        <categories>POP Requirements Information</categories>
        <language>en_US</language>
        <protected>false</protected>
        <shortDescription>Magazine/Newspaper POP Requirements Information</shortDescription>
        <value>1.Proof of Attribution (POA) – digital media file(s) meeting attribution requirements

2.Proof of Cost (POC) – itemized invoice issued by a media owner or marketing services agency

3.Proof of Execution (POE) – report issued by a third party showing:
a.Publication name, ad sizes, number and date(s) of insertions, unit cost and quantity
b.For digital versions: URL, hosting/placement unit cost and quantity</value>
    </labels>
