    <labels>
        <fullName>Core_MDF_Member_com_POP_Req_Info</fullName>
        <categories>POP Requirements Information</categories>
        <language>en_US</language>
        <protected>false</protected>
        <shortDescription>Member.com POP Requirements Information</shortDescription>
        <value>1.Proof of Attribution (POA) – digital media file(s) meeting attribution requirements
a.For graphic ads: URLs of digital proof(s) in XLS file (URLs must remain valid for the entire POP document retention period

2.Proof of Cost (POC) – itemized report issued by member and/or a third party
Cost breakdown may include these types of details:
a.Type of costs, unit cost (cost per click, cost per thousand, cost per day, etc.), quantity, duration, size of banner, type of banner (when applicable)
b.If not placed through an ad network: Website name(s) and URL(s)
c.If placed through an ad network: average cost per unit, campaign name and ad network name

3. Proof of Execution (POE) – same as POA</value>
    </labels>
