    <labels>
        <fullName>Core_MDF_NonPartner_com_POP_Req_Info</fullName>
        <categories>POP Requirements Information</categories>
        <language>en_US</language>
        <protected>false</protected>
        <shortDescription>NonPartner.com POP Requirements Information</shortDescription>
        <value>1.Proof of Attribution (POA) – digital media file(s) meeting attribution requirements

2.Proof of Cost (POC) – itemized invoice issued by a media owner or marketing services agency

3.Proof of Execution (POE) – report issued by a media owner or marketing services agency showing:
a.For an ad: unit cost (cost per click, per 1,000 impressions, per day, per lead, etc.) and quantity
b.For an email: distribution cost and unit cost (cost per sent, per opened, per read, etc.)
c.For lead generation: number of impressions, clicks, and leads
d.If ad is placed directly with the media owner: website name(s) and URL(s)
e.If ad is placed through an ad network: average cost per unit, campaign name and ad network name</value>
    </labels>
