    <labels>
        <fullName>Core_MDF_Radio_POP_Req_Info</fullName>
        <categories>POP Requirements Information</categories>
        <language>en_US</language>
        <protected>false</protected>
        <shortDescription>Radio POP Requirements Information</shortDescription>
        <value>1.Proof of Attribution (POA) – digital media file(s) meeting attribution requirements

2.Proof of Cost (POC) – itemized invoice issued by a media owner or marketing services agency

3.Proof of Execution (POE) – transmission report issued by a third party showing:
a.Station or network name, spot lengths
b.For programmed broadcasts: number of spots, broadcast times, GRPs and/or cost per spot
c.For on-demand broadcasts: number of impressions
d.For sponsorship: program name, number of mentions</value>
    </labels>
