    <labels>
        <fullName>Core_MDF_Seller_Contest_SPIF_POP_Req_Info</fullName>
        <categories>POP Requirements Information</categories>
        <language>en_US</language>
        <protected>false</protected>
        <shortDescription>Seller - Contest SPIF POP Requirements Information</shortDescription>
        <value>1.Proof of Attribution (POA) – digital media file(s) meeting attribution requirements
a.Promotional materials with program details, sales date range, eligible Intel SKUs, and awards

2.Proof of Cost (POC) – itemized reports issued by the member or industry partner, showing:
a.Sales out report showing sales of eligible products and:
For Seller – Target SPIF: calculation of winners, including number of participants, quantity and costs of awards
For Seller – Contest SPIF: number of participants, quantity and costs of prizes
b.If seeking reimbursement for non-award costs: itemized report issued by a member or third party

3. Proof of Execution (POE) – Same as POA and POC</value>
    </labels>
