        <protected>false</protected>
        <shortDescription>Deal Reg Terms &amp; Conditions - Part 1</shortDescription>
        <value>By submitting a deal through the Intel Deal Registration tool, you agree that you and Company are bound by the terms and conditions of the Intel Deal Registration tool.  The terms and conditions of the Intel Deal Registration tool will be deemed accepted by Company upon submission of a deal and the receipt of any benefits provided as a result of submitting your deal via the Intel Deal Registration.  Eligibility for the benefits provided by Intel is conditioned on you meeting the obligations described in the terms and conditions of the Intel Deal Registration tool.</value>
